% §16.13 — a consistency check is a query, and the exit code is the answer.
% The roster is clean: nobody is assigned two shifts on the same day.
assigned("alice", "mon", "open").
assigned("bob", "mon", "close").
assigned("alice", "tue", "open").

% the violation pattern, written as an ordinary rule
double_booked(P, D) :- assigned(P, D, S1), assigned(P, D, S2), S1 != S2.

% the check, phrased affirmatively so `&&` cannot fire on a broken program
?- not double_booked(_, _).
